</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi!<br/>
<br/>
It would be kind if you could extend the Encoding base class with the following 2 methods so that external access to the static maps is easier:<br/>
<br/>
 public static Map &lt;String, String&gt; getCharacterToNameMap () {<br/>
    return Collections.unmodifiableMap (CHARACTER_TO_NAME);<br/>
  }<br/>
<br/>
  public static Map &lt;String, String&gt; getNameToCharacterMap () {<br/>
    return Collections.unmodifiableMap (NAME_TO_CHARACTER);<br/>
  }<br/>
<br/>
Thanks, Philip
  </td>
