                <tr id="issuerow12707496" rel="12707496" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2022" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2022" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2022">PDFBOX-2022</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                silentPrint(no args) doesn&#39;t use the printerJob field
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Apr/14 17:06 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Apr/14 17:10 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Rendering            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      silentPrint(no args) doesn&#39;t use the printerJob field of the class which<br/>
means if you&#39;ve set a printerservice, it is ignored and the default one is<br/>
used.<br/>
<br/>
in org.apache.pdfbox.rendering.PDFPrinter class the silentPrint method is:<br/>
<br/>
public void silentPrint() throws PrinterException<br/>
{<br/>
   silentPrint(PrinterJob.getPrinterJob());<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
It should be:<br/>
<br/>
public void silentPrint() throws PrinterException<br/>
{<br/>
   silentPrint(this.printerJob);<br/>
}<br/>

  </td>
