                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The infinity symbol on page 3 of the file of PDFBOX-1770 is not rendered. I am attaching a &quot;bad&quot; and a &quot;good&quot; rendering. The &quot;good&quot; rendering was faked by removing the line<br/>
{code}<br/>
codeToName.put(key, encodingCodeToName.get(key));<br/>
{code}<br/>
in Type1Glyph2D. This helps keeping a &quot;C121&quot; in a map instead of being replaced with a &quot;y&quot;. The font involved is the &quot;KIJFMP+AdvTex2&quot; font.
