                <tr id="issuerow12709876" rel="12709876" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2038" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2038" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2038">PDFBOX-2038</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Method VisualSignatureParser#parse does not close COSDocument
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrei Solntsev
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrei Solntsev
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Apr/14 21:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Jul/14 01:48 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.4,                     1.8.5,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am adding a visual signature to my PDF.<br/>
<br/>
SignatureOptions options = new SignatureOptions();<br/>
options.setVisualSignature( new FileInputStream(&quot;my.jpg&quot;) );<br/>
<br/>
After a while I am getting the following warning in logs:<br/>
Warning: COSDocument: You did not close a PDF Document<br/>
<br/>
The problem cause is probably the method org.apache.pdfbox.pdfparser.VisualSignatureParser#parse which creates instance of COSDocument, but does not close it.<br/>

  </td>
