                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would make it possible to use Java 7 try-with-resources feature:<br/>
<br/>
try (PDDocument doc = PDDocument.load(outputFile)) {<br/>
  // bla-bla<br/>
  // no need to call doc.close(); explicitly<br/>
}<br/>
