                <tr id="issuerow12711694" rel="12711694" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2050" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2050" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2050">PDFBOX-2050</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add predictor to LZW filter
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/May/14 12:55 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Jun/14 14:34 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/May/14 08:37 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.4,                     1.8.5,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.6,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      According to the PDF spec &quot;LZW and Flate Predictor Functions&quot;, both can have post processing with predictors. It is implemented for Flate but not for LZW. I am adding this by using the existing code from the Flate filter, which I will be moving into a helper class.<br/>
<br/>
While looking at the Flate filter, I noticed that its footprint is higher than needed, i.e. there is too much buffering. I will test this separately and commit only if I can measure an improvement.
  </td>
