                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For example at GlyfSimpleDescript.java<br/>
{code}<br/>
...<br/>
catch (ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException e)<br/>
        {<br/>
            System.out.println(&quot;error: array index out of bounds&quot;);<br/>
        }<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
and also &#39;printStackTrace&#39; like in PageDrawer.java:<br/>
{code}<br/>
...<br/>
catch( IOException io )<br/>
        {<br/>
            io.printStackTrace();<br/>
        }<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Should forward exception or keep silence.
