                <tr id="issuerow12713452" rel="12713452" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2070" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2070" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2070">PDFBOX-2070</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Filter.decode() modifies PDF if there is a filter array
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/May/14 11:40 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/May/14 16:36 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2077                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If there are several filters (filter array) in an image, PDFBox is inserting an empty DecodeParms object here<br/>
{code}<br/>
params.setItem(COSName.DECODE_PARMS, getDecodeParams(params, index));<br/>
{code}<br/>
instead of either inserting an empty COSArray, or (better) do nothing. Saving such a PDF results in it not being displayable in the Acrobat Reader.<br/>
<br/>
Test code:<br/>
{code}<br/>
        PDDocument d = PDDocument.load(&quot;before.pdf&quot;);<br/>
        new PDFRenderer(d).renderImage(0);<br/>
        d.save(&quot;after.pdf&quot;);<br/>
{code}<br/>
The rendering is important because without it, the filtered objects aren&#39;t decoded.
  </td>
