                <tr id="issuerow12715936" rel="12715936" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2089" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2089" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2089">PDFBOX-2089</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Negative width of character
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Later
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Juraj Lonc
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Juraj Lonc
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/May/14 07:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/May/14 16:29 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/May/14 16:29 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This PDF contains text matrix:<br/>
-10.5679 0 0 -11.4 459.0349 19.4155 Tm<br/>
<br/>
that causes IMHO wrong calculation of character width (and height).<br/>
Width and height calculated in PDFStreamEngine are negative numbers, because textMatrix.getXScale() gives negative value.<br/>
<br/>
I think it should be fixed in Matrix.getXScale() and Matrix.getYScale(). Returning value should be fixed by Math.abs()
  </td>
