                                            <td class="description">      In this PDF is a &quot;bullet&quot; character which is not rendered.<br/>
There is some problem with translating code to glyph.<br/>
<br/>
That character has code 127 (0x7F), but mapping for it is not found<br/>
{code}<br/>
14:33:17,966 DEBUG Type1Glyph2D:127 - FKOYIT+MyriadPro-Cond: glyph mapping for 127 not found<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
embedded font contains definition for &quot;bullet&quot; character.<br/>
But &quot;bullet&quot; character has code 183 in mapping table (from StandardEncoding, I suppose).
