                <tr id="issuerow12716656" rel="12716656" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2096" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2096" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2096">PDFBOX-2096</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ICC profile ignored if number of components is 1
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Dominic Tubach
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Dominic Tubach
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/May/14 15:14 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Jun/14 14:34 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 27/May/14 16:52 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The method getRGBImage in PDPixelMap ignores the ICC profile of an ICCBased color space if the number of components is 1 (ll. 320-321 in 1.8.5):<br/>
{code}<br/>
byte[] map = new byte[] {(byte)0xff};<br/>
cm = new IndexColorModel(bpc, 1, map, map, map, Transparency.OPAQUE);<br/>
{code}<br/>
This gives me a blank image in my PDF.<br/>
<br/>
If I use the code in l. 325<br/>
{code}<br/>
cm = colorspace.createColorModel( bpc );<br/>
{code}<br/>
I get the expected result.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m sorry that I&#39;m not allowed to attach the affected PDF. If required I would try to generate a different one.
  </td>
