                                            <td class="description">      The string constructor called in CFFParser#readTagName() should specify an encoding, probably &quot;ISO-8859-1&quot;, otherwise it will not work on systems where the default encoding is something &quot;exotic&quot; (we have some with EBCDIC, but I never tried to run PDFBox there). Patch attached.
  </td>
