</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      PDF uses non-embedded font &quot;CourierNew&quot;.<br/>
OS contains font:<br/>
{code}/usr/share/fonts/truetype/msttcorefonts/Courier_New.ttf: Courier New:style=Regular,Normal,obyèejné,Standard,????????,Normaali,Normál,Normale,Standaard,Normal{code}<br/>
FontManager is not able to find it and warns:<br/>
{code}WARN  [org.apache.fontbox.util.FontManager] (http-0.0.0.0-80-6) Font not found: CourierNew{code}<br/>
<br/>
It seems that the problem is in that space in font name &quot;CourierNew&quot; vs. &quot;Courier New&quot;
  </td>
