</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2121" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2121">PDFBOX-2121</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                NullPointerException when calling org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.edit.PDPageContentStream.setFont()
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Cannot Reproduce
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
