                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                FontBox&#39;s TTFDataStream doesn&#39;t set timezone in readInternationalDate
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
