                <tr id="issuerow12720557" rel="12720557" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2131" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2131" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2131">PDFBOX-2131</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Avoid constructing debug messages if debug log is off
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Trivial
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Petr Slaby
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Petr Slaby
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Jun/14 11:52 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Jun/14 12:16 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Concatenation and formatting of strings takes some time. If a debug message is written to the log at a frequently called place, it should be surrounded by an if(LOG.isDebugEnabled()). Using the if everywhere does not do any harm either.<br/>
<br/>
Attached patch changes two classes which were sticking out in the profiler. The difference in performance is not that big, but, in my application, each millisecond counts.
  </td>
