</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2135                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Rendering of the attached PDF fails with a NPE in PDFStreamEngine at the line 395 (float spaceWidthDisp = ...) because the textMatrix field is null. The reason is that the textMatrix gets reset while processing the first character of the string in PageDrawer#drawType3String(). The attached patch fixes the problem, but I am not quite sure whether it is the right solution.<br/>
<br/>
To debug this, set a breakpoint in PDFStreamEngine#processEncodedText() with the condition &quot;string.length == 2 &amp;&amp; string[1] == 67&quot; and watch the textMatrix field vanish after the first character has been processed.
  </td>
