                                            <td class="description">      PDFStreamEngine and PDFTextStripper don&#39;t really meet our coding conventions and have several unused methods and deprecated code which can safely be removed.<br/>
<br/>
This should clear the way to fixing some bugs in PDFStreamEngine, PDFTextStripper and the various PDFont classes related to text encoding.
