<br/>
<br/>
After fixing PDFStreamEngine.processStream() like this<br/>
{code}<br/>
        if (aPage == null)<br/>
        {<br/>
            graphicsState = new PDGraphicsState();<br/>
        }<br/>
        else<br/>
        {<br/>
