</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The attached file renders incorrectly except at 72dpi; at other resolutions, there are different results that get worse as the resolution gets higher. For shading types 2 and 3, this effect happens only in the 1.8 versions, not in the 2.0 version. For shading types 4 and up, it happens in both 1.8 and 2.0.<br/>
<br/>
The reason is that the transformation is incomplete if the ctm is null.<br/>
<br/>
I found the file here and it was created by Matthias Kramm:<br/>
https://github.com/jdapena/swftools/tree/master/spec
