                                            <td class="description">      In some pdfs, a PDRadioButton can not have any children.  This leads to an NPE when a client calls getValue().  The javadocs say that getValue() can throw an IOException if there is a problem getting the value, but not an NPE.<br/>
<br/>
A doc that shows this issue is:<br/>
[562254|http://digitalcorpora.org/corp/nps/files/govdocs1/562/562254.pdf]
