                                            <td class="environment">      Java 1.7 and Eclipse Kepler
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi, I&#39;m trying to convert in images (png or jpeg) a PDF file in which I&#39;ve added an annotation within each page through the PDAnnotationTextMarkup object.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve used PDFImageWriter to achieve this convertion and the images are correctly generated excepted that the annotation has disappeared.<br/>
<br/>
It seems that there is a mistake because if for example I open my PDF file with acrobat reader and then I re-save it under a new PDF file and then I relaunch my image conversion script with this latter one, the images generated will this time contain the annotations.
  </td>
