                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Regression: Some isartor tests are not passing in 2.0.0
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
