                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I get this exception with the attached file:<br/>
{code}<br/>
java.lang.ClassCastException: org.apache.pdfbox.cos.COSName cannot be cast to org.apache.pdfbox.cos.COSDictionary<br/>
        at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.common.function.PDFunction.create(PDFunction.java:137)<br/>
        at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.graphics.color.PDSeparation.&lt;init&gt;(PDSeparation.java:73)<br/>
        at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.graphics.color.PDColorSpace.create(PDColorSpace.java:126)<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
The cause is this:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
28 0 obj<br/>
[ <br/>
/Separation /PANTONE#20723 /DeviceGray /Identity <br/>
]<br/>
endobj<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Although the identity function isn&#39;t in the spec for the separation colorspace, it is mentioned elsewhere (TransferFunction) so we need it anyway.
