                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I get this with the attached file:<br/>
{code}<br/>
java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: alpha value out of range<br/>
	at java.awt.AlphaComposite.&lt;init&gt;(AlphaComposite.java:624)<br/>
	at java.awt.AlphaComposite.getInstance(AlphaComposite.java:689)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.graphics.blend.BlendComposite.getInstance(BlendComposite.java:45)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.graphics.state.PDGraphicsState.getStrokeJavaComposite(PDGraphicsState.java:577)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.rendering.PageDrawer.strokePath(PageDrawer.java:939)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.util.operator.pagedrawer.StrokePath.process(StrokePath.java:37)<br/>
{code}<br/>
The file has a CA and ca of 1.005 in ExtGState which is incorrect. <br/>
I will fix this by clipping the alphaConstant to a 0..1 interval and put out a warning.
