                <tr id="issuerow12728039" rel="12728039" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2216" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2216" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2216">PDFBOX-2216</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                java.io.IOException: Found Token[kind=NAME, text= ] but expected LITERAL for type1 font
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Jul/14 20:56 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Jul/14 13:28 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        FontBox            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I get this with the attached file on page 3:<br/>
{code}<br/>
java.io.IOException: Found Token[kind=NAME, text= ] but expected LITERAL<br/>
        at org.apache.fontbox.type1.Type1Parser.read(Type1Parser.java:727)<br/>
        at org.apache.fontbox.type1.Type1Parser.readCharStrings(Type1Parser.java:658)<br/>
        at org.apache.fontbox.type1.Type1Parser.parseBinary(Type1Parser.java:522)<br/>
        at org.apache.fontbox.type1.Type1Parser.parse(Type1Parser.java:64)<br/>
{code}<br/>
The cause is that the font has a few NULL bytes (see attached font file). These are regarded as literals.<br/>
<br/>
My solution would be to skip them in Type1Lexer them like we skip spaces, but to put out a warning.<br/>
<br/>
WDYT?
