                                            <td class="description">      PDF parsing fails for attached PDF.<br/>
Stack trace of failure:<br/>
{code}<br/>
Exception in thread &quot;main&quot; org.apache.tika.exception.TikaException: Unexpected RuntimeException from org.apache.tika.parser.pdf.PDFParser@1747c<br/>
