                                            <td class="description">      The class PDComplexFileSpecification needs to be improved as follows:<br/>
<br/>
- analog to &quot;get/setFileXXX&quot; we should add the missing get/setEmbeddedFileUnicode<br/>
- we should rename getUnicodeFile to getFileUnicode to be inline with the other getters and add a setter for that value as well<br/>
- according to the spec, the Dos, Unix and Mac mutations shouldn&#39;t be used anymore, therefore we should rearrange the order in &quot;getFilename&quot;<br/>

