                <tr id="issuerow12730024" rel="12730024" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2243" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2243" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2243">PDFBOX-2243</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: negative dash phase
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Jul/14 12:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Sep/14 14:40 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Jul/14 12:20 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.6,                     1.8.7,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.7,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Parsing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I get this exception with the attached file:<br/>
{code}<br/>
java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: negative dash phase<br/>
        at java.awt.BasicStroke.&lt;init&gt;(Unknown Source)<br/>
        at org.apache.pdfbox.rendering.PageDrawer.getStroke(PageDrawer.java:691)<br/>
        at org.apache.pdfbox.rendering.PageDrawer.strokePath(PageDrawer.java:707)<br/>
        at org.apache.pdfbox.util.operator.graphics.StrokePath.process(StrokePath.java:36)<br/>
        at org.apache.pdfbox.util.PDFStreamEngine.processOperator(PDFStreamEngine.java:564)<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
The reason is this:<br/>
{code}<br/>
[2.88 2.88 2.88 2.88 2.88 2.88 2.88 2.88 ]-2407.142 d<br/>
{code}<br/>
It doesn&#39;t make sense to have a negative dash phase start, so I will adjust negative numbers to 0 and put out a warning.
  </td>
