                                            <td class="description">      java.lang.NullPointerException <br/>
at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.pddocument.getdocumentcatalog(pddocument.java:764) <br/>
at org.apache.pdfbox.util.pdfimagewriter.writeimage(pdfimagewriter.java:125)<br/>
at myfile(26)<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
My File:<br/>
<br/>
21: File f = new File(file);<br/>
22: InputStream in = new FileInputStream(f);<br/>
23: BaseParser bp = new PDFParser(in);<br/>
24: PDDocument pdf = new PDDocument(new COSDocument(), bp);<br/>
25: PDFImageWriter writer = new PDFImageWriter();<br/>
26: writer.writeImage(pdf, &quot;png&quot;, &quot;&quot;, 1, 1, &quot;.pdf&quot;, BufferedImage.TYPE_INT_RGB, 300);<br/>
<br/>
I am not sure why I am getting a null pointer exception. The pdf I am getting the image from has data in it.
