                <tr id="issuerow12732447" rel="12732447" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2262" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2262" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2262">PDFBOX-2262</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Remove usage of AWT fonts
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Aug/14 01:54 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Aug/14 02:55 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel,                     Rendering            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">6</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                                        PDFBOX-2279                        </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2279,                                                PDFBOX-2256,                                                PDFBOX-2263,                                                PDFBOX-2277,                                                PDFBOX-2278,                                                PDFBOX-2280,                                                PDFBOX-2283,                                                PDFBOX-2295,                                                PDFBOX-2827,                                                PDFBOX-2294                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We&#39;re still using AWT fonts to render the &quot;standard 14&quot; built-in fonts, which causes rendering problems and encoding issues (see  PDFBOX-2140). We&#39;re also using AWT for some fallback fonts.<br/>
<br/>
Removal of these AWT fonts isn&#39;t too difficult, we need to load the fonts using the existing PDFFontManager mechanism which has recently been added. All missing TrueType fonts loaded from disk have been using SystemFontManager for a number of weeks now. <br/>
<br/>
We should ship some sensible default fonts with PDFBox, such as the Liberation fonts (see PDFBOX-2169, PDFBOX-2263), in case PDFFontManager can&#39;t find anything suitable, rather than falling back to the default TTF font, but by default we&#39;ll probe the system for suitable fonts.
  </td>
