                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have a pdf that throws an NPE in version 2.0.0 when rendering a specific page to an image.  I&#39;ve tested the pdf with 1.8.6 and it worked correctly.  It logged a warning (java.io.IOException: Error: Unknown shading type 0) but did not throw any exceptions.  I will attach the pdf.  Let me know if you need any more info.<br/>
<br/>
! java.lang.NullPointerException: null<br/>
