                <tr id="issuerow12735797" rel="12735797" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2282" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2282" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2282">PDFBOX-2282</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Visual signature in bad proportions
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Cyril Bremaud
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Cyril Bremaud
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Aug/14 14:54 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Aug/14 16:19 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Aug/14 16:19 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.6,                     1.8.7,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Rendering,                     Signing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2283                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I want to convert into a picture a signed PDF document with a visual signature. This visual signature is done with functions of PDFBox. The resulting image has a visual signature, but in bad proportions (it is much smaller).<br/>
I use addSignature() method to add a visual signature that works very well.<br/>
The problem may be at the addSignature () function or at PDFToImage() function.<br/>
Note that the document signed with PDFBox visualizes very well with Adobe Reader and the signature created with Adobe Reader converts correctly in picture.<br/>
<br/>
Also some PDF documents are very badly converted into image, I think especially at this Adobe document that is totally unreadable when converted:<br/>
http://www.adobe.com/content/dam/Adobe/en/devnet/acrobat/pdfs/acrobat_digital_signature_appearances_v9.pdf<br/>
Could you fix this issue in a future version ?<br/>

  </td>
