                                            <td class="environment">      Java
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">       This is by no means a complete solution to extracting data tables from PDF files. However, it is a step in the right direction. Perhaps. Further work is needed to automatically detect the table layout.<br/>
<br/>
This consists of 2 classes... a PDFTable class to describe table layouts, and a PDFTableStripper class to extract tables and return them as an array of tables, each table being a list of rows, each row being an array of Strings, each String being one cell.
  </td>
