  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hello,<br/>
<br/>
I try to overlay PDF File with other PDF Pages.<br/>
So to say to stamp the first page with a title page and for the following pages I want to stamp the head and also the foot of each page.<br/>
I want to use the version 1.8.6 of pdfbox.<br/>
I tried last time with the version 1.8.2 with success, but now I struggle because my PDF view tells me that the stamped PDF is demaged.<br/>
<br/>
Just to explain the attached files:<br/>
Dok1.pdf = original<br/>
Out.2.pdf = stamped with 1.8.6<br/>
Out.3.pdf = stamped with 1.8.2<br/>
<br/>
So what is the difference between 1.8.2 and 1.8.6 in this case?<br/>
Kind regards<br/>
Markus <br/>

