                <tr id="issuerow12738036" rel="12738036" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2303" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2303" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2303">PDFBOX-2303</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Lazy loading of glyphs in TrueType fonts
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Aug/14 02:14 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 31/Aug/14 02:24 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        FontBox            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      FontBox&#39;s TTF GlyphTable reads the entire glyph table and constructs an object for each glyph. However this is very slow for large external fonts (e.g. Asian) such as &quot;STXihei&quot; which is 15.7MB and has 37255 glyphs. On my machine it takes around 9 seconds for FontBox to load that font just to render 15 glyphs from it.<br/>
<br/>
We can modify GlyphTable to make it lazy so that glyphs are read individually only when needed.
  </td>
