                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      ExternalFonts loads some default fonts via the org.apache.fontbox.util.ResourceLoader. That resourceloader uses it&#39;s own classloader (ResourceLoader.class.getClassLoader()) for loading the given resource.<br/>
The problem is that the resource is in the PDFBox project and the ResourceLoader in the FontBox. In an OSGI environment this is a problem.<br/>

