                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The test files for PDFBox, FontBox, and Preflight include several files under copyright which we probably don&#39;t have permission to redistribute, and need to be removed (or preferably replaced):<br/>
<br/>
pdfbox/src/test/resources/org/apache/pdfbox/<br/>
  - -ttf/ArialMT.ttf (This is actually Bitstream Vera Sans - the license on this might be ok though?)-<br/>
  - -pdfparser/gdb-refcard.pdf (GPL licensed)-<br/>
  - -pdmodel/page_label.pdf (Edited by Foxit PDF for Evaluation Only)-<br/>
  - -pdmodel/font/256.pdf (Copyright 2004 Journal of Combinatorics)-<br/>
<br/>
fontbox/src/test/resources/ttf/<br/>
- -testTrueType.ttf (NewBaskerville, Copyright © 2002 Veronika Elsner)-<br/>
<br/>
preflight/src/test/resources/org/apache/padaf/preflight/font/<br/>
- -true_type.ttf (Subset of Microsoft Arial)-<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
