</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Comment on `org.apache.pdfbox.util.Splitter.createNewDocumentIfNecessary` is out of date
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
