                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The header comment on the `createNewDocumentIfNecessary` method suggests that the method can be overridden in subclasses This is not true since the method is private. The example in the method will not work.<br/>
<br/>
