                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I try to convert a pdf file with transparent images to a image but the opacity is lost in the png result.<br/>
<br/>
It&#39;s seem to be the same issue than https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-993 (fixed in 1.6.0).<br/>
<br/>
I test with code: (1.8.7)<br/>
pdPage.convertToImage(BufferedImage.TYPE_4BYTE_ABGR, 72);<br/>
<br/>
and with:<br/>
java -jar pdfbox-app-1.8.7.jar PDFToImage -imageType png test.pdf<br/>

