{code}<br/>
<br/>
using {{FDFDocument.loadXFDF(new File(&quot;ttt.xfdf&quot;));}}<br/>
<br/>
I get the following exception:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
java.lang.ClassCastException: com.sun.org.apache.xerces.internal.dom.DeferredTextImpl cannot be cast to org.w3c.dom.Element<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.fdf.FDFDictionary.&lt;init&gt;(FDFDictionary.java:105)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.fdf.FDFCatalog.&lt;init&gt;(FDFCatalog.java:68)<br/>
