                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      From the mailing list:<br/>
<br/>
{quote}<br/>
Hello,<br/>
<br/>
I believe the following lines should fallback to false instead of true.<br/>
<br/>
https://github.com/apache/pdfbox/blob/trunk/pdfbox/src/main/java/org/apache/pdfbox/pdmodel/font/PDFont.java#L401-L402<br/>
<br/>
{<br/>
   // unless we can prove that the font is symbolic, we assume that it is<br/>
not<br/>
   isSymbolic = true;<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
Thought to let you know.<br/>
<br/>
Best Regards,<br/>
Hisham<br/>
{quote}<br/>
<br/>
Either the comment or the return value is wrong, but this code is very brittle so we&#39;ll need to do lots of regression testing if any changes are made.
  </td>
