                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The attached file brings this text extraction:<br/>
<br/>
1.8.6:<br/>
For safe! clean! abundant water?in our homes!<br/>
rivers! lakes! and streams?is one of our<br/>
<br/>
1.8.7:<br/>
For safe! clean! abundant water?in our homes!<br/>
rivers! lakes! and streams?is one of our<br/>
<br/>
1.8.8:<br/>
For safe! clean! abundant water?n our homes!<br/>
rivers! lakes! and streams?s one of our<br/>
<br/>
2.0:<br/>
For safe! clean! abundant waterin our homes!<br/>
rivers! lakes! and streamsis one of our<br/>
<br/>
AR:<br/>
For safe! clean! abundant waterin our homes!<br/>
rivers! lakes! and streamsis one of our<br/>
<br/>
So the &quot;i&quot; has been lost in the 1.8.8 version. (2.0 and AR have a character that is invisible when viewing this issue, but can be seen when editing)
  </td>
