                                            <td class="description">      I was told to report a bug here. There are problems with extracting text from PDF files in Dutch. The bug was reported in issue TIKA-1095 (https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/TIKA-1095). The problem can be reproduced with the latest Tika version.<br/>
<br/>
The extracted Text only shows gibberish (or in other cases question marks and incorrect characters).<br/>
<br/>
It was suggested it could be a font problem. Could this be looked into?<br/>
<br/>

