                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The PDFParser requires a startxref offset but FDFs don&#39;t necessarily  have one. As the non-sequential parser is able to read all objects of a pdf/fdf without a startxref-offset/xref table (see PDFBOX-1595) we have to switch from the old sequential parser to the non-sequential parser when loading a FDF file.
