                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      [~gagravarr] noticed that one of our old test files fails a Tika test now with PDFBox 1.8.7 and Java 1.6.<br/>
<br/>
I just tested the pure PDFBox app built with PDFBox 1.8.8-SNAPSHOT, and I&#39;m getting the same exception with Java 1.6 and Java 1.7.<br/>
<br/>
