                                            <td class="description">      Attached file is just line one from a file where every piece of text has these problems.  All the other lines were removed with Nitro to make a small test case.<br/>
<br/>
This is the output from PrintTextLocations example:<br/>
String[211.92,356.8801 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=1.75392 space=190528.28 width=1.7052002]?<br/>
String[129.84,347.04 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=2.72832 space=288435.66 width=2.679596]?<br/>
String[70.32,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=7.0643997]?<br/>
