String[82.2564,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=6.333603]?<br/>
String[88.590004,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=6.577202]?<br/>
String[95.167206,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=6.0899963]?<br/>
String[101.2572,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=6.333603]?<br/>
String[107.590805,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=6.0899963]?<br/>
String[113.6808,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=4.8720016]?<br/>
String[118.5528,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=3.1668015]?<br/>
String[121.719604,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=6.333603]?<br/>
String[128.0532,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=6.577194]?<br/>
String[134.63042,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=6.0899963]?<br/>
String[140.72041,299.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=3.31296 space=349985.12 width=3.1667938]?<br/>
String[522.95984,293.28 fs=58.0 xscale=58.0 height=1.36416 space=150394.36 width=1.4616089]?<br/>
<br/>
Fontsize is way too big (should be more like 8), value for space is ridiculous, height is too small.  And each character is coming through as a &#39;?&#39;.  The original file has this on every piece of text.<br/>
<br/>
In Acrobat everything looks fine, both in the original and in this test case.<br/>

