                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In our use case we take a large PDF, split into multiple separate document by some algorithm, then optionally apply to each document stationary via overlay and a varying number of attachments. Each final document is then written to an in-memory byte[] for database storage.<br/>
<br/>
We&#39;re seeing an occasional crash when saving this document. It is not immediately repeatable so we suspect it&#39;s a bad reference after garbage collection. Stacktrace to follow.
  </td>
