                <tr id="issuerow12756710" rel="12756710" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2512" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2512" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2512">PDFBOX-2512</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                OutOfMemory while signing large documents
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Thomas Chojecki
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Thomas Chojecki
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Thomas Chojecki
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Nov/14 15:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Dec/14 12:55 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/Dec/14 09:11 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.8            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Parsing,                     Signing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      While working with large documents, we found some memory issues.<br/>
<br/>
1. The method close() in the COSDocument, clones the objectpool and does not clean it properly. The cloning in getObjects() cause a OutOfMemory exception.<br/>
<br/>
2.The COSWriter copy the whole pdf into the memory for signing and does not use BufferedInputStream for the FileInputStream which also has a big performance impact. (PDFBOX-1798)<br/>
<br/>
3. The cloning of COSStreams cause a OutOfMemory exception<br/>
<br/>
I used the CreateSignature example with a about 150 MB big document from here:<br/>
https://cdn-reichelt.de/bilder/downloads/reichelt_01-2015_DE_B_HQ.pdf<br/>
<br/>
Additionaly I add a RandomAccessFile to the PDDocument.load in the CreateSignature class.<br/>
<br/>
PDDocument doc = PDDocument.load(document,new RandomAccessFile(new File(&quot;d:\\temp.bin&quot;), &quot;rw&quot;)); (this prevent the OOM for the third case)<br/>
<br/>
The use of a BuffedInputStream in case two, will increase the signing speed from more than 5 minutes to less than 1 minute. 
  </td>
