                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
I just download a pdf form page:<br/>
http://download.jw.org/files/media_books/32/es15_P.pdf<br/>
and wants extract text from this document.<br/>
I use command:<br/>
java -jar pdfbox-app-1.8.7.jar ExtractText -encoding UTF-8 es15_P.pdf resultFile-UTF-8.txt<br/>
But I see some problems for exmaple:<br/>
1. I see in text file &#39;STX&#39; and &#39;ETX&#39; instead of &#39;ę&#39; and &#39;ą&#39;.<br/>
2. extractor return a text &#39;naprzykładmiłe&#39; instead of &#39;na przykład miłe&#39; (page 4, line 6).<br/>
<br/>
Maybe it is some small problems.
