                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The current implementation of the AcroForm field retrieval methods don’t provide an easy access to get to all fields as <br/>
 - one needs to retrieve the documents root fields<br/>
 - check if these are non-terminal fields<br/>
 - retrieve their childs<br/>
 - move on until all terminal fields have been retrieved<br/>
<br/>
There should be a way to easier get access to all terminal fields  
  </td>
