                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      TSAClient.java asks for the ASN1ObjectIdentifier of &quot;SHA-394&quot;. What is really meant is &quot;SHA-384&quot;. &quot;SHA-394&quot; is the model number of a chinese centre-pull hand towel dispenser.<br/>
<br/>
I also found the correct object identifiers in various places within Bouncy Castle code and will insert them.
  </td>
