                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The command line tools shall be enhanced to have the same behavior across all tools.<br/>
<br/>
From the discussion on the dev mailing list<br/>
- add an -h option to print the usage<br/>
- print the usage to System.err and use an exit code of 1 if there was an invalid command line parameter<br/>
- print messages on exceptions to System.err<br/>
- rethrow the exception so java can handle it if it will terminate afterwards anyway<br/>
- use an exit code of 1if rethrowing doesn&#39;t make sense
  </td>
