                <tr id="issuerow12768506" rel="12768506" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2611" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2611" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2611">PDFBOX-2611</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
            <span class="parentIssue">PDFBOX-2610</span>
                possibly incorrect error message &quot;Hexa String must have only Hexadecimal Characters&quot; in preflight
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Sub-task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Jan/15 18:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/Jan/15 17:44 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Preflight            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I get with the files pdfa_article_v11.pdf and PDFExportDialog2.pdf of the &quot;unclear&quot; part of the Bavaria test suite.  The cause is text like this in a PDF:<br/>
{code}<br/>
9D978E 6C6456 CECBC7 B5B1AA F3F2F1 E6E5E3 473D2C 857E73 DAD8D5 F3CFD2 DB6E7A 544A3A 605748 C2BEB8 E79EA6 D24A58<br/>
918B81 FCF3F4 A9A49C EDB6BC D55663 F6DBDD 787165 E18790 F9E7E9 F0C2C7 D8626F DE7B85 E4939B EAAAB1 CF3E4D 3B301E<br/>
{code}<br/>
In a comment to PDFExportDialog2.pdf, pdflib tells &quot;Unclear: hexadecimal string with whitespace characters (ambiguous in ISO 19005-1)&quot; and &quot;PDFlib opinion: whitespace in hex strings should be ignored&quot;. The PDF-Tools validator says it is a valid PDF. Solid Documents is unable to process the file.<br/>
<br/>
[~msahyoun] do you know if this has been clarified in PDF/A-2b or PDF/A-3b? It is valid in &quot;ordinary&quot; PDF files.
  </td>
