                <tr id="issuerow12769042" rel="12769042" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2619" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2619" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2619">PDFBOX-2619</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
            <span class="parentIssue">PDFBOX-2610</span>
                XMP dates contain time zone, while document info dates do not, and this isn&#39;t detected by preflight
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Sub-task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maruan Sahyoun
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Jan/15 17:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Jan/16 18:03 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Feb/15 09:58 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.8,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.9,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Preflight            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-3135                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Another one from the Bavaria test suite:<br/>
{code}<br/>
/CreationDate(D:20090317081112) <br/>
/ModDate(D:20090317081112)<br/>
&lt;xmp:CreateDate&gt;2009-03-17T08:11:12Z&lt;/xmp:CreateDate&gt;<br/>
&lt;xmp:ModifyDate&gt;2009-03-17T08:11:12Z&lt;/xmp:ModifyDate&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
The info dates do not have a timezone, but the xmp dates do (Z = &quot;Zulu&quot;). This information (whether there was a timezone information in the string) is &quot;lost&quot; in our conversion methods :-(<br/>
<br/>
Amusingly, PDF Tools says the file is valid.
  </td>
