                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      PDFBox does not support named actions, see this question:<br/>
https://stackoverflow.com/questions/28060866/<br/>
<br/>
The user has this code<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;&lt; /Type /Annot /Subtype /Link /Rect [0.0 0.0 100.0 100.0] /H /P /BS 1049 0 R /A 1050 0 R &gt;&gt;<br/>
<br/>
1050 0 obj &lt;&lt;/N /GoBack /S /Named&gt;&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
The solution is to derive a new class from PDAction and also to change to PDActionFactory.
