                                            <td class="description">      When a text including single quote is output by an embedded TTF font,  it turns into garbage. This can be reproduced by an attached code.<br/>
<br/>
This is because the cid code of single quote is 0x0A and escaped in  COSWriter.writeString(). The attached patch fixes this.<br/>

