</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      PDFontDescriptorAFM::getLeading is returning 0F because leading is not present in the FontMetric structure for AFM fonts.<br/>
<br/>
Thats not correct since leading is a redundant metric, and can be calculated by height - ascent - ABS(descent) (or 1000-ascent-ABS(descent)).<br/>
<br/>
ABS: Absolute value.
  </td>
