                <tr id="issuerow12775128" rel="12775128" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2685" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2685" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2685">PDFBOX-2685</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                COS &#39;primitive&#39; types are mutable
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maruan Sahyoun
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Feb/15 11:53 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Mar/17 18:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.8,                     1.8.9,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">6</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-3320,                                                PDFBOX-626                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      From [~torakiki]:<br/>
They are cached and they are mutable so this:<br/>
{code}<br/>
        COSInteger cosint = COSInteger.get(10);<br/>
        cosint.setValue(50);<br/>
        //lets move to a totally unrelated part of my software<br/>
        System.out.println(COSInteger.get(10));<br/>
{code}<br/>
prints COSInteger(50) so basically I ask for a 10 and get a 50, isn&#39;t it weird (and error prone)? ... or the way around, I call cosint.setValue(50) at some point in the software and that makes it a 50 everywhere I used COSInteger.get(10).<br/>
<br/>
That&#39;s of course also true for the other mutable attributes setDirect and setNeedToBeUpdate.
  </td>
