                <tr id="issuerow12779586" rel="12779586" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2698" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2698" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2698">PDFBOX-2698</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                PDFToImage IndexOutOfBoundsException
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            ccouturi
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            ccouturi
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Mar/15 21:05 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Mar/15 14:10 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Mar/15 21:21 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.8,                     1.8.9,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.9,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When I convert the pdf test file to image I get a Exception :<br/>
<br/>
(I test with the latest trunk commit git-svn-id: https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/pdfbox/trunk@1663941)<br/>
<br/>
&gt; java -jar ./app/target/pdfbox-app-2.0.0-SNAPSHOT.jar PDFToImage -imageType png  testFile.pdf<br/>
<br/>
