|  |  |--LKALLLJCAELEPOKIHONKIICKICONPEJB.form2.f3 = no value available,  type=org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.interactive.form.PDPushButton<br/>
{code}<br/>
With the 1.8.9 version, it outputs:<br/>
{code}<br/>
1 top-level fields were found on the form<br/>
|--LKALLLJCAELEPOKIHONKIICKICONPEJB<br/>
{code}<br/>

