                <tr id="issuerow12783573" rel="12783573" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2719" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2719" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2719">PDFBOX-2719</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                The addSignature() method always set the visual signature on the last page of the PDF
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maruan Sahyoun
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Cyril Bremaud
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Cyril Bremaud
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Mar/15 12:00 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Mar/15 12:17 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Signing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The {{addSignature()}} method always set the visual signature on the last page of the PDF.<br/>
This is certainly due to the following lines in {{PDDocument}} class :<br/>
<br/>
{code:title=PDDocument.java|borderStyle=solid}<br/>
...<br/>
int startIndex = Math.max(Math.min(options.getPage(), 0), pageCount - 1);<br/>
PDPage page = catalog.getPages().get(startIndex);<br/>
...<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
I think {{Math.min}} and {{Math.max}} have been inverted.<br/>

  </td>
