                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I get this exception :<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
java.awt.geom.IllegalPathStateException: missing initial moveto in path definition<br/>
	at java.awt.geom.Path2D$Float.needRoom(Path2D.java:280)<br/>
