                                            <td class="description">      Trying to extract text on a Korean PDF gives me a lot of warnings :<br/>
WARNING: No Unicode mapping for US (33) in font DVCAYA+WtKoBaeumMyungjoL063zb4?Pw<br/>
avr. 01, 2015 12:05:32 PM org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.PDSimpleFont toUnicode<br/>
WARNING: No Unicode mapping for NAK (33) in font JYLDGG+WtKoBaeumMyungjoL053zb4?Pw<br/>
