WARNING: Invalid ToUnicode CMap in font FZEFOY+WtKoBaeumGothicL0422b4?Pw<br/>
avr. 01, 2015 12:05:32 PM org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.PDSimpleFont toUnicode<br/>
WARNING: No Unicode mapping for DEL (33) in font FZEFOY+WtKoBaeumGothicL0422b4?Pw<br/>
avr. 01, 2015 12:05:32 PM org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.PDFont &lt;init&gt;<br/>
