</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows 7, JRE 1.8.0, Eclipse
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The zoom property of PDPageXYZDestination is currently an int, which means it can&#39;t be anything that isn&#39;t a multiple of 100%, as the zoom level is measured between 0 (=0%) and 1 (=100%), or higher, not between 0 and 100.<br/>
Therefore it should be changed to a float.
  </td>
