                <tr id="issuerow12788297" rel="12788297" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2746" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2746" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2746">PDFBOX-2746</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                PDPageContentStream.saveGraphicsState() saves wrong nonStrokingColor and throws an exception
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Radomir Mladenovic
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Radomir Mladenovic
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Apr/15 19:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Apr/15 20:08 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Method PDPageContentStream.saveGraphicsState() has the following code:<br/>
<br/>
{quote}<br/>
        if (!nonStrokingColorSpaceStack.isEmpty())<br/>
        \{<br/>
            nonStrokingColorSpaceStack.push(strokingColorSpaceStack.peek());<br/>
        }<br/>
{quote}<br/>
<br/>
Notice peek of *strokingColorSpaceStack* instead of *nonStrokingColorSpaceStack*. Needless to say it also throws an exception if strokingColorSpaceStack was not set.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
