</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have a custom COSWriter which compresses all streams and runs a SHA1 sum over each object, only writing one instance of each object with the same SHA1 sum.<br/>
<br/>
This really helps compress PDFs.<br/>
<br/>
I use this by calling MyCustomCOSWriter.write(PDDocument);<br/>
<br/>
The trouble is that I have no way of calling the font subsetting that happens in PDDocument.save(). <br/>
<br/>
Could we have a method to perform that font subsetting manually?
  </td>
