{code}<br/>
Exception in thread &quot;main&quot; java.lang.ClassCastException: org.apache.pdfbox.cos.COSObject cannot be cast to org.apache.pdfbox.cos.COSDictionary at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.PDDocument.addSignature(PDDocument.java:474)<br/>
