                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When setting the value of COSString to the Euro sign the encoding is wrong<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
    COSString string = new COSString(&quot;€&quot;);<br/>
    System.out.println(string);<br/>
{code}<br/>
produces this output<br/>
{code}<br/>
    COSString{¬}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
whereas the same code using 1.8 produces the correct result<br/>
{code}<br/>
    COSString{€}<br/>
{code}
