                <tr id="issuerow12826532" rel="12826532" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2783" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2783" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2783">PDFBOX-2783</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
            <span class="parentIssue">PDFBOX-2576</span>
                Remove getCOSDictionary() method, adjust getCOSObject() return type
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Sub-task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/May/15 11:17 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/May/15 11:24 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As discussed on the mailing list: Remove getCOSDictionary(), use getCOSObject() instead, change return type to COSDictionary or whatever is applicable. If possible, change javadoc too.<br/>
<br/>
While working on it, I noticed code like this:<br/>
{code}<br/>
        if (newDomain == null)<br/>
        {<br/>
            getCOSDictionary().removeItem(COSName.DOMAIN);<br/>
        }<br/>
        else<br/>
        {<br/>
            getCOSDictionary().setItem(COSName.DOMAIN, newDomain);<br/>
        }<br/>
{code}<br/>
this should be replaced with<br/>
{code}<br/>
        getCOSObject().setItem(COSName.DOMAIN, newDomain);<br/>
{code}<br/>
because setItem() calls removeItem() when the second parameter is nulll.<br/>

  </td>
