<br/>
My problem with the code below is that the fields&#39; data are printed vertically instead of horizontally.<br/>
{quote}<br/>
And another description on stackoverflow<br/>
<br/>
http://stackoverflow.com/questions/16952710/filling-landscape-pdf-with-pdfbox
