                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When creating a new bookmark with the same page number as an existing bookmark, the resulting destination is offset by 1 compared to the old destination.<br/>
<br/>
This results in the bookmark being set for the next page, which could be a non-existing page.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve added a class with an example pdf and my own output pdf. Run with argument of a path to where you have the pdf, including a trailing slash.
  </td>
