                                            <td class="environment">      http://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/pdfbox/trunk/doap_PDFBox.rdf
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      DOAP files can contain details of multiple release Versions, however each must be listed in a separate release section, for example:<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;release&gt;<br/>
