                <tr id="issuerow12828688" rel="12828688" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2793" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2793" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2793">PDFBOX-2793</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                /Dests dictionary isn&#39;t supported
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/May/15 20:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 12/Sep/15 13:01 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/May/15 17:59 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.9,                     1.8.10,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.10,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2968                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have received a non public file that has a /Dests dictionary in the /Catalog, and this is not supported by PDFBox. This is a concept from PDF 1.1 that is no longer used since PDF 1.2, but it is legal and not deprecated, only discouraged.<br/>
<br/>
What needs to be done is to include an additional lookup in PDOutlineItem.findDestinationPage() in the PDNamedDestination section. And an additional getter in PDDocumentCatalog, and a new class to encapsulate that &quot;dictionary of names and corresponding destinations&quot;.
  </td>
