{code}<br/>
Exception in thread &quot;main&quot; java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Requested array size exceeds VM limit<br/>
	at java.util.Arrays.copyOf(Arrays.java:3230)<br/>
	at java.io.ByteArrayOutputStream.grow(ByteArrayOutputStream.java:113)<br/>
