                                            <td class="description">      When debugging it&#39;s useful to be able to get an indirect COS object&#39;s generation and id numbers. However, for PD objects there&#39;s no way to retrieve the COSObject which points to the result of getCOSObject().<br/>
<br/>
Only COSDocument contains this information, so I&#39;m adding a new method which looks up the COSObjectKey for a given COSBase, assuming that object is indirect (e.g. the target of a COSObject).
