                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The protected method `writeString` in `PDFTextStripper` can receive more characters than TextPositions. I tracked the problem down to the `normalizeAdd` method where, for multi-character unicode words, Multiple characters can be added to a line while only a single TextPosition object is added to the corresponding list of TextPositions.<br/>
<br/>
This pdf: https://www.aclweb.org/anthology/W/W13/W13-4011.pdf contains such a character.
