after I modified the field &quot;IBAN Antragsteller&quot; with &quot;12345678901234567890&quot;. But that one isn&#39;t an XFA form?!<br/>
{code}<br/>
                PDField field = pdf.getDocumentCatalog().getAcroForm().getField(&quot;IBAN Antragsteller&quot;);<br/>
                if (field instanceof PDTextField)<br/>
                {<br/>
                    PDTextField txField = (PDTextField) field;<br/>
                    txField.setValue(&quot;12345678901234567890&quot;);                    <br/>
                }<br/>
{code}<br/>

