  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I load a PDDocument from a byte stream as follows,<br/>
{code}<br/>
    		byte[] body = BASE64EncoderDecoder.decodeBuffer(BASE64body);<br/>
    		ByteArrayInputStream bis = new ByteArrayInputStream(body);<br/>
        	pdfDocument = PDDocument.load(bis);<br/>
        	<br/>
        	// Unlock it if needed<br/>
        	if (pdfDocument.isEncrypted())<br/>
        	{<br/>
           		StandardDecryptionMaterial sdm = new StandardDecryptionMaterial(password);<br/>
        		pdfDocument.openProtection(sdm);<br/>
        	}<br/>
{code}<br/>
If there is no encryption then all is fine.  However, as soon as I put a password on the PDF the values of the &#39;PDChoiceField&#39; type lose their values &lt;null&gt;.  All other field types come out correctly.<br/>
<br/>
getSelectedOptions brings back null, and &#39;getValue()&#39; also returns null with the encrypted PDF, but work fine when not encrypted.<br/>
<br/>
Many thanks<br/>

  </td>
