</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When embedding a Type 1 font, the Widths array is invalid, because the codes are ordered based on the order of the named glyphs in the font file, instead of in encoding order.<br/>
<br/>
Additionally, there&#39;s an NPE because no GlyphList is set for a newly embedded PDType1Font.<br/>
<br/>
There&#39;s also no way to choose the encoding, it&#39;s always taken from the AFM file.
