                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Text that wraps over multiple lines in PDF documents is not extracted correctly by PDFBox. The expected behaviour would be for it to be extracted as a single line, but instead a line break is inserted at each wrap point.<br/>
