                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2814,                                                PDFBOX-1350,                                                PDFBOX-3681,                                                PDFBOX-678                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The attached file is a reduced version of the file from PDFBOX-1350. It should show &quot;T U S&quot; at the bottom left but it doesn&#39;t. I believe that the cause is very similar to PDFBOX-2814 (text rendering in mode 7), except that this time, the text is not splitted within one &quot;TJ&quot; segment, but across several &quot;Tj&quot; segments.<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
BT<br/>
7 Tr<br/>
/F1 1.00000 Tf<br/>
0.01063 0.00000 0.00000 0.00573 0.05521 0.16300 Tm<br/>
0 -1.01768 Td<br/>
(\000\065) Tj<br/>
/F1 1.00000 Tf<br/>
0.01063 0.00000 0.00000 0.00573 0.05521 0.16300 Tm<br/>
1.38462 -1.01768 Td<br/>
(\000\066) Tj<br/>
/F1 1.00000 Tf<br/>
0.01063 0.00000 0.00000 0.00573 0.05521 0.16300 Tm<br/>
1.69789 -1.01768 Td<br/>
/F1 1.00000 Tf<br/>
0.01063 0.00000 0.00000 0.00573 0.05521 0.16300 Tm<br/>
2.01116 -1.01768 Td<br/>
/F1 1.00000 Tf<br/>
0.01063 0.00000 0.00000 0.00573 0.05521 0.16300 Tm<br/>
2.32442 -1.01768 Td<br/>
(\000\064) Tj<br/>
ET                                                                                              <br/>
/Im1 Do<br/>
{code}<br/>

  </td>
