                <tr id="issuerow12848914" rel="12848914" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2903" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2903" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2903">PDFBOX-2903</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ClassCastException at PDFParser:667
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Jul/15 14:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Jan/16 12:01 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Jul/15 05:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.10            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.11            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Parsing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      from &quot;skenny&quot; in the user mailing list:<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m using PDFMergerUtility to merge a number of PDF input streams and write<br/>
them to an HTTP response output stream.  One of the PDFs is failing at line<br/>
667 in PDFParser:<br/>
{code}<br/>
    final COSName objectType = (COSName)strmObj.getItem( COSName.TYPE );<br/>
{code}<br/>
The result of getItem(COSName.TYPE) is a COSString (value &quot;Metadata&quot;) and<br/>
not a COSName.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220">            <span title="24/Jul/15 16:23"><time class="livestamp allow-future" datetime="2015-07-24T16:23:10+0000">24/Jul/15 4:23 PM</time></span>
    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312520"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312323"></td>
