                <tr id="issuerow12849888" rel="12849888" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2907" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2907" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2907">PDFBOX-2907</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Non-termination in PDResources.createKey()
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Falko Riemenschneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Falko Riemenschneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Jul/15 10:03 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Jul/15 21:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 29/Jul/15 21:28 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2822                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When trying to set a font using CSPageContentStream.setFont() a new key is required which is created in  PDResources.createKey(), ca line 450.<br/>
<br/>
If the dict keySet contains &quot;F1&quot;, &quot;F2&quot;, &quot;F4&quot;, &quot;F5&quot; then just trying to use <br/>
{code}<br/>
(dict.keySet().size() + 1)<br/>
{code} <br/>
will not find a new key und the loop won&#39;t terminate.<br/>
<br/>
This here terminates:<br/>
{code}<br/>
        String key;<br/>
        int i = dict.keySet().size();<br/>
        do<br/>
        {<br/>
            i++;<br/>
            key = prefix + i;<br/>
        }<br/>
        while (dict.containsKey(key));<br/>
{code}
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
