                                            <td class="description">      {code}<br/>
Exception in thread &quot;AWT-EventQueue-0&quot; java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
        at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.graphics.shading.PDShading.getFunctionsArray(PDShading.java:354)<br/>
        at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.graphics.shading.PDShading.evalFunction(PDShading.java:386)<br/>
