{code}<br/>
<br/>
Found at https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js/issues/5509 .  The cause of the bug is that we&#39;re not throwing an exception for a missing function. Fun fact: Adobe Reader isn&#39;t able to display the file correctly, the contents of the yellow box are missing.
