</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Class {{PDColorSpace}} contains field: <br/>
{code}protected COSArray array;{code}<br/>
But {{PDIndexed}} class also has field:<br/>
{code}private COSArray array;{code}<br/>
Thus, {{PDColorSpace.getCOSObject}} return {{null}} instead of array from {{PDIndexed}}.<br/>
Possible solutions:<br/>
# discard duplicate field from {{PDIndexed}}<br/>
# override method {{getCOSObject()}}
  </td>
