Maven 3.2.5<br/>
PDFBox 2.0.0-SNAPSHOT
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I couldn&#39;t sign this particular PDF using pdfbox. I could sign bigger PDFs, so it&#39;s not about the size. Whenever I sign it, and try to open with adobe reader, it says &quot;there was a problem opening this pdf&quot;, but it opens the unsigned version immediately. I&#39;m using version 2.0.0-SNAPSHOT<br/>
<br/>
I think it&#39;s because the pdf does not have a xref table. That&#39;s the only difference I could find with other signable pdfs.
  </td>
