                <tr id="issuerow12858949" rel="12858949" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2947" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2947" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2947">PDFBOX-2947</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                latest pdfbox-app-2.0.0-20150826.013253-1615 not support old functionalities.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Gayan Wijenayaka
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Gayan Wijenayaka
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Aug/15 11:09 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Aug/15 20:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 27/Aug/15 20:27 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows 7
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Our code use pdfbox-app-2.0.0-20150603.071006-1379.jar to print the pdf document as below.<br/>
<br/>
PDFPrinter pdfPrinter = new PDFPrinter(doc, printerJob, Scaling.ACTUAL_SIZE, Orientation.AUTO, null, false, 0);<br/>
<br/>
pdfPrinter.silentPrint(attributes);<br/>
<br/>
We need to update the latest pdfbox(pdfbox-app-2.0.0-20150826.013253-1615.jar).<br/>
 But it does not support the pass to print job and silent print method. <br/>
Current pdfbox release doesn&#39;t have PDFPrinter and added new two classes PDFPrintable and PDFPageable. <br/>
But with these two classes we cannot meet the our requirement. <br/>
<br/>
please give some advice to fix this issue.<br/>
<br/>
Best regards,<br/>
Gayan.
  </td>
