                <tr id="issuerow12901018" rel="12901018" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-2998" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-2998" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2998">PDFBOX-2998</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Enhance the text extraction capabilities
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Reopened
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andreas Meier
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andreas Meier
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Sep/15 13:20 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Dec/16 08:48 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Text extraction            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">10</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      PDFBox will need some -document layout analysis tools- enhancement to the current text extraction to extract text correctly.<br/>
At the Moment the text of a document is extracted using the position of single characters.<br/>
This may lead to wrong results, due to the format of the file.<br/>
<br/>
There are good tools such as  https://code.google.com/p/lapdftext which we could use to compare our current output.<br/>
<br/>
Possible enhancements are<br/>
- enhance matching of text to a certain line i.e. don&#39;t mix up text from different lines<br/>
- better handling of rotated text<br/>
- handling of vertical text<br/>
- ability to get additional text properties such as font, font size ...<br/>
<br/>
Some of these are already logged as individual tickets
