                <tr id="issuerow12901367" rel="12901367" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3002" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3002" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3002">PDFBOX-3002</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                PDF files not closed after load fails
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Sep/15 17:13 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Jan/16 12:01 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Sep/15 16:38 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.10,                     1.8.11,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.11,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In 2.0, PDF files are not closed affter load() if the parsing fails. I will fix this and also add tests (in 2.0 and 1.8) to make sure that PDF files are closed after load(). See also the discussion with Timo Boehme in [PDFBOX-2883|https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-2883?focusedCommentId=14935447&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-14935447].
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
